<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on the FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on the FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. in New York, Frankfurt branch has issued 40 million American-style call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the FTSE 100 index, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 06.MAY.97-07.JUL.98   PAYDATE	12.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 2000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  4518 (O6.MAY.97)  GBP/FRF 9.499</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE     STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL     5000	1.97 FRF  15.27 PCT  21.8 X</p>
<p> CALL     4500	4.18 FRF  9.35 PCT   10.3 X</p>
<p> PUT	4500	3.03 FRF  -7.46 PCT  14.2 X</p>
<p> PUT	4000	1.36 FRF  -14.64 PCT 31.5 X</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
